{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a spacious country house in the heart of Russia \u2014 a place where time flows differently, where every moment is filled with simple joys and peace. A leisurely life awaits you among green vegetable beds and flowering flower beds, the familiar smells of herbs from childhood, and the rustling of the wind in the birch trees.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find yourself on a suburban plot with a small house, vegetable beds, and a garden surrounding it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main activities  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Vegetable garden and beds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u2022 Planting tomato, cucumber, and potato seeds in designated areas.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u2022 Watering from an old Soviet bathtub.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u2022 Harvesting: juicy tomatoes and crisp cucumbers become your pride and joy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Flower beds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Planting petunia, marigold, and dahlia seedlings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Preparations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Mastering home preservation: green tomatoes, cucumbers, and apples for the winter. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Household chores  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   \u2022 Cleaning our little house and the surrounding area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Repairing the old fence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmosphere and immersion  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Sounds: the soft rustling of leaves, the chirping of grasshoppers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Music: light chords of the balalaika and harmonica, folk melodies in a modern arrangement.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Interface: minimalistic hints with light icons that do not interfere with the contemplative mood.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2013 Camera: free movement, the ability to capture frames/photos and save them in a photo album.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why play  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is not a race for points, but a path to inner balance. It gives you the opportunity to immerse yourself in the simple but important rituals of country life, feel connected to nature, learn patience and unhurried creativity. Give yourself the opportunity to stop, take a deep breath and enjoy the moment \u2014 because this is the real peace.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dacha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/b49a4418429b8d7f579ae7ff60e68c619ae0168f.jpg"},{"name":"Watering can","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/44d7280e4d1e4e1fd6e89545d6d3f4cc3ab1189f.jpg"},{"name":"Kebabs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/d5f9eae4f87c260f65a2b9be02a308fbf3af390a.jpg"},{"name":"Beds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/465d7f87d19befa966fe89dce9d16aa019f5c800.jpg"},{"name":"All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/97e6d601009a42f2260c6f2fd2867d04a343d3ab.jpg"},{"name":"Landscape designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/5f17207b5d7f9ec7148c1d44b13d5f3cb192b0ab.jpg"},{"name":"Yablochny spas","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/b3f85ca39a403b953d6981da577a56a97e51eef9.jpg"},{"name":"Canning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/f22eda285761da64a770ab521e709198f9ce318d.jpg"},{"name":"The Scavenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/cb9d34139e349dc28f5b9731c84532705108538b.jpg"},{"name":"Dog lover","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3854020/d7c3d0f344dc569f00c2f9d8ca39284377d836b2.jp